Topic: Personal Interview (MOST DECISIVE ROUND) 🎯🔥

👉 This is the final deciding stage
👉 Here, your entire personality is judged

1️⃣ What is Personal Interview?

👉 One-to-one interaction with Interviewing Officer (IO)

⏱️ Duration: 30–60 minutes

🎤 Interview Environment
6
2️⃣ What IO Checks

They evaluate your:

Confidence
Honesty
Communication
OLQs (Officer Qualities)
Consistency with PIQ, TAT, WAT, SRT
3️⃣ Types of Questions Asked
🔹 1. Personal Questions
Tell me about yourself
Your strengths & weaknesses
Your daily routine
🔹 2. Family Questions
What does your father do?
Your relation with parents
🔹 3. Education Questions
Why low/high marks?
Favorite subject
🔹 4. Hobby-Based Questions

👉 Deep questions from your hobby

🔹 5. Situation-Based Questions

👉 Similar to SRT

Example:
“What will you do if your friend cheats?”

🔹 6. Defence-Related Questions
Why do you want to join Armed Forces?
Why not private job?
4️⃣ How to Answer (VERY IMPORTANT)
✅ Perfect Answer Style

👉 Simple + Honest + Logical

❌ Wrong Answer

“I want to join defence because I like uniform”

✅ Correct Answer

“I want to join defence to serve the nation, take responsibility, and work in a challenging environment where I can contribute effectively.”

5️⃣ Body Language (VERY IMPORTANT)

✅ Sit straight
✅ Maintain eye contact
✅ Smile naturally
✅ Speak calmly

❌ Avoid
Fidgeting
Looking down
Overconfidence
6️⃣ Common Mistakes

❌ Giving fake answers
❌ Memorized responses
❌ Contradicting PIQ
❌ Lack of confidence

7️⃣ PRO STRATEGY (SELECTION SECRET)

👉 Follow this formula:

💥 Think → Be Honest → Speak Clearly

👉 If you don’t know answer:

✅ Say:
“I am not aware of it, sir. I will learn.”

💥 This shows honesty

8️⃣ Rapid Fire Questions

👉 IO may ask quickly:

10–15 questions continuously

👉 Stay calm & answer naturally

9️⃣ Practice Task (VERY IMPORTANT)

Answer these:

1️⃣ Tell me about yourself
2️⃣ Why do you want to join defence?
3️⃣ Your biggest weakness?
4️⃣ Your daily routine
5️⃣ Your role model

🧠 SECRET TIP

👉 IO is not checking knowledge

👉 He checks:

Your thinking
Your honesty
Your personality

💥 Be REAL = You get recommended

